  "  expected_option : the 1-based number of the option for 'option', null otherwise",
  "Annotation rules: 'option' only when the reply clearly chooses one option (its words, a synonym, a clear paraphrase, its number, a final self-correction); a reply between options, naming two, negating labels without choosing, sarcastic or with a number outside the scale is 'ambiguous'. Drop any case a reasonable annotator could label differently.",
  "No content from the evaluation scenarios nor from the examples of the prompts."
 ],
